{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The show must go on, even if it kills you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Curtainfall</i> is a fast-paced action roguelike set in a twisted theatrical underworld. Step into the spotlight as a masked performer fighting through cursed circus zones while uncovering fragments of your lost identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together melee attacks, special abilities, and combat buffs to create devastating builds on the fly. Each run plays out like a new act, with  bizarre enemies pulled straight from a nightmare masquerade. And when the final curtain rises, give the performance of your afterlife.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797930?t=1757665878","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797930/d10129fbfa02a16ff14ee6c0aeb1e24f6f3de80c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757665878","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797930/1badfed6b6c9d365c6ab1d731e6ad018397481a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757665878","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797930/1badfed6b6c9d365c6ab1d731e6ad018397481a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757665878","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The show must go on, even if it kills you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Curtainfall</i> is a fast-paced action roguelike set in a twisted theatrical underworld. Step into the spotlight as a masked performer fighting through cursed circus zones while uncovering fragments of your lost identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together melee attacks, special abilities, and combat buffs to create devastating builds on the fly. Each run plays out like a new act, with  bizarre enemies pulled straight from a nightmare masquerade. And when the f